{"seq":3,"slug":"mass-customization-assembly","title":"大规模定制与装配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/digital-fabrication/mass-customization-assembly","wordCount":1477,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"大规模定制与装配\">大规模定制与装配</h1><p>工业革命给了我们一个看似铁律的权衡：要便宜就得标准化，要定制就得贵。一千块一模一样的预制板很便宜，一千块各不相同的板曾经贵到不可承受。数字建造打破了这条铁律——当机器直接读取每块构件的几何文件，「做一千块相同的」和「做一千块不同的」成本几乎一样。这就是大规模定制（mass customization）的核心命题。本篇讲清它的经济学原理、技术工作流与装配逻辑，它是 <a href=\"additive-3d-printing\">增材制造与3D打印</a> 与 <a href=\"robotic-cnc-fabrication\">机器人建造与数控加工</a> 在生产组织层面的归宿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-定制的边际成本归零\">核心概念：定制的边际成本归零</h2><p>大规模定制的经济学基础，是数字制造让「定制的边际成本」大幅下降。在传统制造中，每个不同的构件都需要专门的模具、专门的工装、专门的设定，定制成本随种类线性甚至超线性增长。在数字制造中，构件的差异只是数据文件的差异，机器换一个文件就能做一个不同的件，几乎没有额外的换型成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[参数化主模型] --&gt; B[每个构件唯一几何]&#10;  B --&gt; C[文件到工厂 File-to-Factory]&#10;  C --&gt; D{数字制造}&#10;  D --&gt; E[CNC 切割]&#10;  D --&gt; F[机器人加工]&#10;  D --&gt; G[3D 打印]&#10;  E --&gt; H[带编号的定制构件]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[现场装配 / 模块化]&#10;  I --&gt; J[非标准化的整体建筑]\">flowchart TD\n  A[参数化主模型] --&gt; B[每个构件唯一几何]\n  B --&gt; C[文件到工厂 File-to-Factory]\n  C --&gt; D{数字制造}\n  D --&gt; E[CNC 切割]\n  D --&gt; F[机器人加工]\n  D --&gt; G[3D 打印]\n  E --&gt; H[带编号的定制构件]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[现场装配 / 模块化]\n  I --&gt; J[非标准化的整体建筑]</pre><p>用成本模型对比更直观。传统制造的总成本可近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>trad</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>tooling</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{trad}} = N \\cdot c_{\\text{unit}} + K \\cdot c_{\\text{tooling}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trad</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tooling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是构件数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是不同种类数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>tooling</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{tooling}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tooling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每种的工装成本。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 增大（定制程度高），第二项急剧膨胀。数字制造中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>tooling</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{tooling}} \\approx 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7692em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tooling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，于是总成本几乎只与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 有关，与种类数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 解耦——这正是「大规模」与「定制」得以共存的数学解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文件到工厂-贯通的数字链条\">文件到工厂：贯通的数字链条</h2><p>实现大规模定制的关键工作流是「文件到工厂」（File-to-Factory，F2F）。它把设计的数字几何无缝传递到生产设备，中间没有人工绘制加工图的环节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>传统流程</th>\n<th>文件到工厂</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设计到加工</td>\n<td>人工绘制每个构件加工图</td>\n<td>参数化模型自动导出制造文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构件差异</td>\n<td>标准化以控制成本</td>\n<td>每件可不同，成本不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误差来源</td>\n<td>图纸理解偏差</td>\n<td>模型即真理，误差极小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息流向</td>\n<td>单向、断裂</td>\n<td>双向、连续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>F2F 的威力在于把 <a href=\"../parametric-algorithmic/parametric-generative-design\">参数化建模与生成式设计</a> 的参数化主模型与 <a href=\"robotic-cnc-fabrication\">机器人建造与数控加工</a> 的制造设备直接打通。设计师调整主模型的一个参数，下游每个构件的几何、加工文件、乃至装配编号都自动更新。这条链条的可靠性依赖于上游数据的准确，与 <a href=\"../bim-digital-workflow/bim-information-model\">BIM原理与信息模型</a> 强调的信息一致性一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预制-模块化与装配式\">预制、模块化与装配式</h2><p>大规模定制在建造组织上的体现，是从「现场湿作业」转向「工厂预制 + 现场装配」。这个谱系有不同的粒度。</p>\n<p>构件级预制是最基本的——梁、柱、板在工厂做好运到现场拼装。模块级预制（modular construction）走得更远，把整个房间甚至整套公寓在工厂里连同装修、管线一起造好，现场只需吊装堆叠、连接接口。这种「像搭乐高一样盖楼」的方式，把现场工作压缩到极致，大幅缩短工期、提升质量、减少现场浪费。</p>\n<p>数字建造让模块化摆脱了「千篇一律」的旧形象。过去模块化等于标准化的方盒子，而 F2F 让每个模块可以各不相同却同样高效生产——这正是 ETH Zurich 空间木构（见 <a href=\"robotic-cnc-fabrication\">机器人建造与数控加工</a>）展示的：几何复杂的定制单元在工厂机器人产线上批量制造，现场组装。装配的核心挑战转移到了「接口设计」：定制构件如何用尽量统一的连接节点拼合，是装配式设计的关键智慧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计-公差与现实约束\">设计、公差与现实约束</h2><p>大规模定制并非没有代价，几个现实约束塑造了它的真实边界。</p>\n<p>其一是公差累积。当大量定制构件装配在一起，每个构件的微小误差会累积。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个构件各有独立的标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 的随机误差，总误差的标准差约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（随机误差按平方根累积），而非简单相加——这意味着装配设计必须预留容差节点来吸收累积误差。其二是物流。定制构件各不相同，运输、堆放、现场识别都比标准件复杂，每个构件的编号、追踪、就位顺序都需数字化管理。其三是设计协同的提前量：F2F 要求设计在很早阶段就冻结到可制造的精度，留给后期变更的余地很小，这与传统设计「边做边改」的习惯冲突。理解这些约束，才能把大规模定制用在它真正擅长的地方——而非盲目追求「每件都不同」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>大规模定制的经济学基础是数字制造让定制的边际成本归零：构件差异只是数据差异，成本与种类数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 解耦。</li>\n<li>关键工作流是「文件到工厂」F2F：参数化主模型自动导出制造文件，无人工绘图环节，模型即真理。</li>\n<li>F2F 打通参数化设计与制造设备，调一个参数则下游构件几何、加工文件、装配编号全部自动更新。</li>\n<li>建造组织上从现场湿作业转向工厂预制 + 现场装配，模块化让「像搭乐高一样盖楼」成为可能且不再千篇一律。</li>\n<li>现实约束有三：公差按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 累积需容差节点、定制件物流需数字化追踪、设计须提前冻结到可制造精度。</li>\n<li>上游工艺见 <a href=\"additive-3d-printing\">增材制造与3D打印</a> 与 <a href=\"robotic-cnc-fabrication\">机器人建造与数控加工</a>，参数化主模型见 <a href=\"../parametric-algorithmic/parametric-generative-design\">参数化建模与生成式设计</a>，数据一致性见 <a href=\"../bim-digital-workflow/bim-information-model\">BIM原理与信息模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大规模定制与装配","id":"大规模定制与装配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：定制的边际成本归零","id":"核心概念-定制的边际成本归零"},{"level":2,"text":"文件到工厂：贯通的数字链条","id":"文件到工厂-贯通的数字链条"},{"level":2,"text":"预制、模块化与装配式","id":"预制-模块化与装配式"},{"level":2,"text":"设计、公差与现实约束","id":"设计-公差与现实约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"机器人建造与数控加工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/digital-fabrication/robotic-cnc-fabrication"},"next":{"title":"AI 与生成式建筑设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/frontiers/ai-generative-architecture"}}